==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|tólf|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{recons|twalif|lang=gem-pro}}. Compare Faroese {{term|tólv|lang=fo}}, Danish and Norwegian {{term|tolf|lang=da}}, Danish {{term|tolv|lang=no}}.

===Cardinal number===
'''tólf''' {{indecl}}

# '''[[twelve]]'''; the cardinal number after [[ellefu#Icelandic|ellefu]] and before [[þrettán#Icelandic|þrettán]].

====Related terms====
* (''ordinal form'') [[tólfti]] {{m}}, [[tólfta]] {{f|n}}

